 "format": "Commander",
 "name": "Pantlaza: Sun-Favored Stampede",
 "notes": [
  "Chose Pantlaza over Itzquinth. Pantlaza discovers X (X = the entering Dinosaur's toughness) once each turn, so nearly every Dinosaur brings a free spell. Itzquinth is a fine 2-drop but gives no card flow, so he's in the 99.",
  "Base is the Foundations Commander deck Tramplesaurus Rex (Ghalta, Primal Hunger): its Dinosaurs, mana creatures, draw, Beast Within, Bite Down, Sol Ring and Overwhelming Stampede all carry over. Ghalta stays in the 99.",
  "White is mostly a splash for Swords, Path, Generous Gift, Fumigate, Kinjalli's Sunwing and Ghalta and Mavren. Green is the main color (12 Forests).",
  "Discover note: you may always put the hit in hand instead of casting it, so Fumigate and Bite Down are safe to run.",
  "Estimated, not simulated: wins around turns 8–10 with hasty fat, Overwhelming Stampede or Gishath. Slowest start of the five, so the 16 ramp pieces matter. Early defense relies on big blockers and 7 spot answers.",
  "Polyraptor is deliberately out: with Forerunner of the Empire or Marauding Raptor it makes an infinite loop, which breaks Bracket 2.",
  "Rares and mythics to pick up or check your binder for: Devil Dinosaur; Exotic Orchard; Fabled Passage; Fumigate; Ghalta and Mavren; Gishath, Sun's Avatar; Heroic Intervention; Kinjalli's Sunwing; Palani's Hatcher; Regisaur Alpha; Temple of Abandon; Temple of Plenty; Temple of Triumph; Topiary Stomper; Trumpeting Carnosaur",
  "Commons and uncommons to pick up or check your binder for: Annoyed Altisaur; Atzocan Seer; Balamb T-Rexaur; Blossoming Sands; Command Tower; Crested Herdcaller; Cultivate; Drover of the Mighty; Earthshaker Dreadmaw; Evolving Wilds; Farseek; Forerunner of the Empire; Generous Gift; Itzquinth, Firstborn of Gishath; Ixalli's Lorekeeper; Jungle Shrine; Knight of the Stampede; Kodama's Reach; Nature's Lore; Path of Ancestry; Raging Swordtooth; Ranging Raptors; Rugged Highlands; Savage Stomp; Terramorphic Expanse; Thundering Spineback; Wind-Scarred Crag"
 ],
